            "review_title": "Review at A Buu Sai Gon",
            "review_text": "Ivi F\n32 contributions\n0\nDisaster\nApr 2019 • Couples\nJust arrived from the plane, our hotel opposite and we decided to go in for dinner and rest. The first thing to bring the letter, the waitress was waiting all the while we debated what to ask (I was nervous) my wife ordered spaghetti with tomato sauce and seafood and I penne a la carbonara. They brought her dish and mine arrived 14 minutes later. There was a hair in the dish and the pasta was not very rich. mine was worse ... they were not pennesi no conchiglie (that would give me the same ...) but it was not carbonara ... it was a rare sauce of melted cheese soaking all the shells and it was disgusting. we leave the entire dishes. They did not ask us if it was good or bad .... they charged us the napkins !!! fatal!!! We pay for nothing. in fact, I got angry at the supermarket in front and bought THE DINNER to take to the room.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 28, 2019",
