            "review_text": "NFR90\n113 contributions\n0\nChill atmosphere near the hotel area\nJan 2018 • Friends\nThis review is based on my visit a few years ago though but I still hear good reviews from the people who went there recently.\nIts located on the same road on which a lot of hotels are operating, very easily accessible (a couple minutes of walking from the nearest hotel) as this restaurant is really just by the roadside.\nWhen I was there, I guess it was a karaoke night? So please be warned that the singers are the customers and not everyone is a good singer 😅\nIf I am visiting Ho Chi Minh City again, I would definitely come again.\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2018",
