            "review_text": "Rustytraveler671\nGuam, Mariana Islands16 contributions\n0\nGreat find!!!!!!!!!!!\nAug 2016 • Solo\nWhat a great little place to eat. I arrived late to my hotel and was starved. Walking along the street people were coming in and out and poked my head in. Sat at the bar and had the best prawn salad of my life. Along with a couple of dozen steamed clams with a few cold Tigers my night was perfect.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 11, 2016",
