            "review_text": "Hardlyanexpert\nMelbourne, Australia149 contributions\n0\nWow-this food is good!\nMar 2015 • Solo\nI stayed at a hotel a few doors down and,wanting a break from Vietnamese food,got 2 take away meals from A Buu.The first was chilli chicken with fried rice and it was very good but it was the second meal that blew me away.\nChicken with mushroom sauce,chips and vegetables-it was one of the best meals I have had anywhere and to top it off,it was delivered by their waiter to my room on a plate with cutlery!\nThe cost of the meal was about a third of what I would have paid back home and the serving was much bigger.This is my new western food go-to in HCMC and it is well worth a try if you need a good feed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 21, 2015",
